gametitle=Phantasy Star Universe (USA) [SLUS-21194]
comment=DNAS bypass (PSU project). Sony's DNAS servers are gone, so the check can never pass.

// Generated by extract/bypass.py from patches/bypass.json. Do not hand-edit.
// Unlabelled on purpose: a [Section] patch is a toggleable cheat that defaults to OFF.
// Game module ERX/PSU_US.GZ loads at 0x248000. Every write is guarded by an E-type compare of the site's
// relocated retail low halfword, so nothing is written before the module is in memory or
// over other code (a memory-card System File build), and once written the guard goes quiet.
//
//   va 0x352314  jal DNAS status poll (stub 0x48b634, import 0x10) -> b 0x352374 (the poll's 'operation complete' path)
//   va 0x352590  jal DNAS op1 start (stub 0x48b62c, import 0xf) -> move v0, zero (started OK)
//   va 0x3524e0  jal DNAS op2 start (stub 0x48b61c, import 0xd) -> move v0, zero
//   va 0x352438  jal DNAS op3 start (stub 0x48b624, import 0xe) -> move v0, zero

